WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.437 --> 00:00:05.105
- JAHARI, MY FRIEND.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.773
THERE ARE A LOT OF BEAUTIFUL
WOMEN OUT HERE TODAY.

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:08.542
[chuckles]
- YEAH.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:11.111
KAREEN, MY FRIEND,
YOU SPEAK THE TRUTH.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.580
- WELL, I DO WHAT I CAN.

00:00:13.614 --> 00:00:15.148
- OOH.
- OH...

00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:16.149
WOW.
- RIGHT?

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:17.818
- HA-HA.
- BLIP.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.553
- SHA-BLOIMPS.
- [laughs]

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.722
- YOU KNOW, I CAUGHT A LITTLE
GLIMPSE OF HER FOOT NUT.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.757
[clicks tongue]
- YOU SAW ANKLE BONE?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.025
- WELL...

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.827
- GOT SOME ANKLE CLEAVAGE,
YOU DIRTY DEVIL, HUH?

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.828
YOU SAW?

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.096
- GOD, I SAW.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.031
[both talking over each other]

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.666
- YES, KAREEN.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.735
[laughs]
- HEH...

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:35.736
- VERY TASTY...

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:39.506
- EH...

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.843
- MM.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.678
- HMM-HMM.
- OH...

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.446
- DUDE, DID YOU SEE
THE BRIDGE ON THAT NOSE?

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.615
- I MEAN, IF IT IS
ANY INDICATION...

00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:50.851
- WOW.
- HHH-HOLY GARBANZO BEANS.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.052
- I'LL TELL YOU WHAT.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:54.054
THAT IS A BRIDGE
I'D LIKE TO CROSS.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.590
[both laugh]

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.726
- THIS IS MY BOY.
THIS IS MY BOY.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.329
- [laughing]
- THIS IS MY BOY.

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.665
OH.

00:01:09.203 --> 00:01:12.339
- HMM.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.575
- NOT A LOT TO GO ON THERE.
- NOT REALLY. NOT REALLY.

00:01:14.608 --> 00:01:15.609
GOOD HEIGHT.
- GOOD HEIGHT.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.610
- GOOD HEIGHT.

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:17.978
- CRAZY TALL.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.180
- [growls]
YEAH, LIKE 5'9".

00:01:20.214 --> 00:01:22.749
HEH...

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:25.752
- COME ON. COME ON. COME ON.
- [muttering]

00:01:25.786 --> 00:01:28.355
- COME ON. SHE'S TALL.
SHE'S TALL. SHE'S TALL.

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.591
- THAT'S RIGHT. SHE'S TALL.
THERE'S NOTHING TO BE DONE.

00:01:30.624 --> 00:01:31.925
- GETTING WET. LET ME SEE--

00:01:31.959 --> 00:01:34.728
LET ME SEE IT FROM BEHIND.
LET ME SEE IT FROM BEHIND.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.530
THAT'S HOW YOU HIT IT.
THAT'S HOW YOU HIT IT.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:37.698
- JAHARI,
CAN I TELL YOU SOMETHING

00:01:37.731 --> 00:01:39.967
IN CONFIDENCE RIGHT NOW?
- OKAY.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.134
- [whispers]
I'M A VIRGIN.

